      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The reason I agree with this is that \"vote with your wallets\" simply doesn't work. A small minority spending a lot of money is enough to shift how the value of things is perceived by creators and it all goes downhill, look at every mobile game with microtransactions/roblox, we NEED rules on what can be sold and ways to report content that break those rules before this is opened to everyone.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
