      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "No 🗿\n\nThere is no need to prevent \"Pay to Win\". If world author doing \"Pay to Win\" things and we don't like it, we'll not play this. That's it. Marketing strategy is creator's choose. See no reason to limit freedom.",
